ual style, match its other buttons"},{"demo":"<button class=\"back-top-btn pill\">↑ top</button>","when":"When you need to clearly explain what a button does"}]},"usageMocks":{"back-top-page":"<div class=\"mk-scene\"><div class=\"mk-skel\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:85%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:70%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:90%\"></i></div><span style=\"position:absolute;right:8px;bottom:8px;width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--brand);color:var(--on-brand);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:13px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(29,33,41,.25)\">↑</span></div>","back-top-list":"<div class=\"mk-scene\"><div class=\"mk-skel\"><span class=\"mk-select\" style=\"align-self:flex-start\">全部状态<i class=\"mk-caret\"></i></span><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:80%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:65%\"></i></div><span style=\"position:absolute;right:8px;bottom:8px;width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--brand);color:var(--on-brand);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:13px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(29,33,41,.25)\">↑</span></div>","back-top-mobile":"<span class=\"mk-phone\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:90%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:70%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:80%\"></i><span style=\"align-self:flex-end;width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--brand);color:var(--on-brand);font-size:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">↑</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">放在移动端易触及的位置</span>","back-top-appear":"<div class=\"mk-scene\"><div class=\"mk-skel\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:82%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:66%\"></i></div><span style=\"position:absolute;right:8px;bottom:8px;width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--brand);color:var(--on-brand);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:13px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(29,33,41,.25)\">↑</span><span style=\"position:absolute;left:10px;bottom:8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">滚动到合适位置后出现</span></div>","back-top-short":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:80%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:52%\"></i></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">页面较短，不需要返回顶部</span>","back-top-cover":"<div class=\"mk-scene\"><div class=\"mk-skel\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:78%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:60%\"></i></div><span class=\"mk-btn primary\" style=\"position:absolute;right:8px;bottom:8px\">提交</span><span style=\"position:absolute;right:8px;bottom:8px;width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--brand);color:var(--on-brand);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:13px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(29,33,41,.25)\">↑</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">不应遮挡页面主要操作</span>","back-top-tiny":"<div class=\"mk-scene\"><div class=\"mk-skel\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:80%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:62%\"></i></div><span style=\"position:absolute;right:6px;bottom:6px;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--border);color:var(--text-3);font-size:11px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">↑</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">尺寸过小且对比度不足，按钮难以识别</span>","back-top-multi":"<div class=\"mk-scene\"><div class=\"mk-skel\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:80%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:62%\"></i></div><span style=\"position:absolute;right:8px;bottom:8px;width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--brand);color:var(--on-brand);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px\">☰</span><span style=\"position:absolute;right:38px;bottom:8px;width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--brand);color:var(--on-brand);display:inline-flex;al